# Automated Engineering SOPs

Whenever the user mentions a bug, feature, or architecture review, automatically execute the corresponding SOP from `docs/agents/engineering_sop.md`.

## Response Prefix
Always lead with the compact phase card:
```markdown
> 📌 **[SOP 名称]** `[■■□□□] 阶段 X/Y: 阶段名称` | **关联工单**: `#ID` (若有)
> **当前目标**: [一句话描述] | **下一步驱动**: [主动引导下一步动作]
```

## SOP Mapping
- **SOP-1 (Bug Fix)**: Capture & Issue -> Feedback Loop -> Hypotheses -> TDD -> Deploy.
- **SOP-2 (Feature)**: Listen & Grill -> Domain/ADR -> Spec -> TDD Implement -> Deploy.
- **SOP-3 (Review)**: Scope -> Audit bloat/depth -> Refactor Spec -> Dual-axis Review.
- **Lite Mode**: Trivial text/style fixes use 2-step fast track.
